{
  "sn35.31:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 35.31 ",
  "sn35.31:0.2": "3. Sabbavagga ",
  "sn35.31:0.3": "Paṭhamasamugghātasappāyasutta ",
  "sn35.31:1.1": "“Sabbamaññitasamugghātasappāyaṁ vo, bhikkhave, paṭipadaṁ desessāmi. ",
  "sn35.31:1.2": "Taṁ suṇātha. ",
  "sn35.31:1.3": "Katamā ca sā, bhikkhave, sabbamaññitasamugghātasappāyā paṭipadā? ",
  "sn35.31:1.4": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu cakkhuṁ na maññati, cakkhusmiṁ na maññati, cakkhuto na maññati, cakkhuṁ meti na maññati. ",
  "sn35.31:1.5": "Rūpe na maññati …pe… ",
  "sn35.31:1.6": "cakkhuviññāṇaṁ na maññati, cakkhusamphassaṁ na maññati, yampidaṁ cakkhusamphassapaccayā uppajjati vedayitaṁ sukhaṁ vā dukkhaṁ vā adukkhamasukhaṁ vā tampi na maññati, tasmimpi na maññati, tatopi na maññati, taṁ meti na maññati. ",
  "sn35.31:1.7": "Yañhi, bhikkhave, maññati, yasmiṁ maññati, yato maññati, yaṁ meti maññati, tato taṁ hoti aññathā. ",
  "sn35.31:1.8": "Aññathābhāvī bhavasatto loko bhavamevābhinandati …pe… ",
  "sn35.31:1.9": "jivhaṁ na maññati, jivhāya na maññati, jivhāto na maññati, jivhā meti na maññati. ",
  "sn35.31:1.10": "Rase na maññati …pe… ",
  "sn35.31:1.11": "jivhāviññāṇaṁ na maññati, jivhāsamphassaṁ na maññati. ",
  "sn35.31:1.12": "Yampidaṁ jivhāsamphassapaccayā uppajjati vedayitaṁ sukhaṁ vā dukkhaṁ vā adukkhamasukhaṁ vā tampi na maññati, tasmimpi na maññati, tatopi na maññati, taṁ meti 